WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:21.638
The farmer's wife went into the house.

2
00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:24.464
Tom jumped onto the window.

3
00:00:24.465 --> 00:00:27.145
He looked into the kitchen.

4
00:00:27.146 --> 00:00:30.654
The farmer's wife had more milk.

5
00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:42.803
She poured it into a tall pot.

6
00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:48.807
Then she left.

7
00:00:48.808 --> 00:00:51.300
Tom licked his lips.

8
00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:53.999
He leaned closer . . .

9
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.374
Tom fell onto the kitchen floor!

10
00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:01.218
Just then a mouse peeped out of a hole.

11
00:01:01.222 --> 00:01:06.742
"What are you doing here?" she asked.

12
00:01:06.743 --> 00:01:09.378
"Nothing," Tom said.

13
00:01:09.379 --> 00:01:15.017
But he was looking at the tall pot.

14
00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:17.021
Tom jumped up.

15
00:01:17.022 --> 00:01:19.736
He stepped slowly toward the milk.

16
00:01:19.737 --> 00:01:23.407
Tom stood on his back legs.

17
00:01:23.408 --> 00:01:28.024
He peeked into the pot.

18
00:01:28.025 --> 00:01:32.148
"Mmm!" Tom said.

19
00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:35.040
"The milk smells wonderful!"

20
00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:38.551
Tom dipped a paw into the pot.

21
00:01:38.552 --> 00:01:41.205
But he couldn't reach the milk.

22
00:01:41.206 --> 00:01:44.948
Tom leaned closer . . .

23
00:01:44.949 --> 00:01:47.507
"Ahh!" Tom cried.

24
00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:51.372
The pot tipped over!
